        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>16 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nClean 16\" ladder style contemporary door pull handle made of stainless steel.  For use on residential and commercial doors such as storefront doors. The warm satin stainless steel  finish requires little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO158-pull-size.gif?v=1704354618\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"16 Inch Contemporary Door Pulls\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Longer <a href=\"/products/4-foot-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>48\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/5-foot-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>60\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/6-foot-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>72\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/7-foot-long-stainless-steel-door-pull\"><b>84\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 16\" contemporary ladder style handles feature a nice easy to grip 1-1/4\" round pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. <b>Glass door</b> mounting requires <b>5/8\" Diameter hole</b> in glass. Wood/fiberglass doors requires 3/8\" Diameter hole.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for DWD-DJO158-630 Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 12\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" Round</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bolts Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA Compliant</b></a></li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel </li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "16 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "These 16 inch contemporary ladder style handles feature a nice easy to grip 1-1/4 inch round pull handle that is very comfortable. Optional mounting kits for use on wood, metal or glass doors. For use on residential and commercial doors. The warm satin stainless steel  finish requires little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a clean contemporary look is desired.",
